# @agent-k/shared

**역할:** protocol types, work event types, common error types만.

**의존성:** shared ← 모든 packages. shared는 비즈니스 패키지를 의존하지 않음.

**해도 됨:** pure types, zod schemas for messages, Typed Work Event definitions

**하면 안 됨:** 비즈니스 로직, React, vscode, provider HTTP, tool executors
